NAME
    gfx2hw(1) - a utility for converting GraphEd-style graphics to HoverWare
    object files.

SYNOPSIS
    gfx2hw oldfile >newfile

DESCRIPTION
    The gfx2hw utility converts old-style GraphEd object files to new-
    style HoverWare object files.  These new files can be used with the
    provided spinner program to animate flying scenes.

SEE ALSO
    hw(3)
